      "story_intro": "真正的春天到来后，溪谷的守灵却没有离开。它们拄着新抽的柳鞭站在两条山道上，敲打盾牌：安眠会磨钝刀刃，村庄敢不敢在丰年再战一场？艾吉替全村答了腔——树篱的灯，今夜全部点亮。",
      "story_intro_en": "After true spring came, the valley wardens did not leave. They stood on both lanes with fresh willow whips and beat their shields: peace dulls the blade — dares the village fight again in a year of plenty? Eggy answered for everyone — tonight every hedge lantern is lit.",
      "story_outro": "守灵收起柳鞭，滚回溪谷深处。山道重归平静，只留下盾面上新磕出的一圈豁口，亮得像笑。",
      "story_outro_en": "The wardens folded their whips and rolled back into the deep valley. Only a fresh ring of dents on their shields remained, glinting like laughter."
    },
