      "story_intro": "荆棘篱在春天疯长，把两条旧战道拱成了绿廊。巡篱的艾吉发现：芽心里裹着分裂的嗡鸣和疗愈的甜香——上一季的残种没有死，它们在丰年里学会了更聪明的合作。烧掉，还是再赢一次？艾吉选择了后者。",
      "story_intro_en": "Thorn hedges grew wild in spring, arching both old war roads into green tunnels. Patrolling Eggy heard splitting hums and healing sweetness wrapped inside the buds — last season's seeds did not die; in a year of plenty they learned cleverer teamwork. Burn them, or out-earn them again? Eggy chose the latter.",
      "story_outro": "绿廊安静下来，新芽从焦黑的战痕里钻出。荆棘承认：春天的规矩，是把每一次复发都长成更硬的篱。",
      "story_outro_en": "The green tunnel settled and new sprouts pushed through scorched battle scars. Bramble admitted: spring's rule is to grow every relapse into a harder hedge."
    },
