      "story_intro": "水晶环廊是守灵比武场：两条长长的回廊在尽头并拢，雪球般的护盾队和召唤队在此互相较技。环灵提出条件——若村庄能在最长、最绕的双径上仍守住蛋，它们便承认丰年也有利爪。",
      "story_intro_en": "The crystal gallery is the wardens' sparring ground: two long corridors merge at its end while shield-snowballs and summoner convoys rival there. The ring spirits set terms — if the village can hold the egg on the longest, windingest twin lanes, they will grant that plenty, too, has claws.",
      "story_outro": "环廊的灯次第熄灭，像一场体面的鞠躬。护盾与喽啰都退回棱镜里，约定下一个季轮再战。",
      "story_outro_en": "The gallery lamps went out one by one like a gracious bow. Shields and minions retreated into the prisms, promising a rematch next turning of the season."
