      "story_intro": "风信者从两条山脊同时俯冲：飞兵掠过塔顶直取蛋窝，抗术者踩着弹射与毒雾的缝隙推进。守灵说这是最后一试——丰年的村庄不能只会守地面。艾吉把对空的塔位一一擦亮。",
      "story_intro_en": "Wind heralds dove from both ridges at once: flyers skimmed the turrets straight for the nest while resisters advanced through gaps in chain-lightning and venom. The last trial, said the wardens — a village of plenty must not master only the ground. Eggy polished every anti-air turret one by one.",
      "story_outro": "谷口的风停了。飞兵绕场一周致意，抗术者收起硬壳——立体之试，村庄过关。",
      "story_outro_en": "Wind died at the gorge mouth. The flyers looped once in salute, the resisters folded their shells — the village passed the trial of the third dimension."
