      "story_intro": "泉眼庭院的深处，季节守灵倾巢而来：藤蔓镇、棱镜镇与风车镇各遣一尊首领镇物，分踏三条旧路同赴春之凯旋。艾吉登上最高的草丘——上一季的三个魔王已碎，而活下来的村庄，值得这一场堂堂正正的凯旋。",
      "story_intro_en": "From the deep spring yard the seasonal wardens came in force: one lord totem apiece from Bramble Town, Prism Town and Windmill Town, marching the three old roads toward spring's triumph. Eggy climbed the tallest mound — last season's three demon lords lay shattered, and a village that survived deserved this head-on triumph.",
      "story_outro": "三尊镇物在泉眼边化作花泥，春天自此常驻。庭院的花开了又开——而守灵的低语刚刚落下：下一个季轮，远方还有未醒的山谷。",
      "story_outro_en": "The three totems melted into flower-mould beside the spring, and the season stayed. Blossom after blossom opened in the yard — while the wardens' whisper had barely settled: next turning of the year, valleys farther off are still un-woken."
